Yep.  Nethack supports this.  To tell you the truth, that's why I made
xterm support color.  Unfortunately, it only supports it if you are
using terminfo, and you have to either change your xterm colors, or
change the numbers in termcap.c.  It probably wouldn't be too hard to
hardcode the color stuff in, though.


